{"id":"motivo","lemma":"motivo","pos":"noun","rank":932,"glosses":["reason, ground, motive"],"ipa":"/moˈtibo/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"motivos"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/1/19/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-motivo.wav","examples":[{"text":"¿Cuál podría ser el motivo?","en":"What could be the reason?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/600072","words":[{"g":"which one, what, which"},{"g":"to be able to, can","l":"poder"},{"g":"to be"},{"g":"the"},null]},{"text":"Teníamos nuestros motivos.","en":"We had our reasons.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/501577","words":[{"g":"to have","l":"tener"},{"g":"our, ours, to us","l":"nuestro"},null]},{"text":"¿Cuál es el motivo de su viaje?","en":"What's the purpose of your trip?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/354112","words":[{"g":"which one, what, which"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"his / her / your"},{"g":"voyage"}]},{"text":"Ella dejó la escuela por motivos de salud.","en":"She quit school for health reasons.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/687450","words":[{"g":"she"},{"g":"to leave","l":"dejar"},{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"school"},{"g":"for / by"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"bless you"}]},{"text":"No se conoce el motivo.","en":"The motive is unknown.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/301862","words":[{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"oneself"},{"g":"to know","l":"conocer"},{"g":"the"},null]}]}